<title>USA: Maine Blue Ox baseball team might get new stadium.</title>
<headline>Maine Blue Ox baseball team might get new stadium.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangor, Maine, city councilors on the finance committee on Tuesday will consider issuing a request for a study on a multipurpose stadium.</p>
<p>The more than three-thousand seat stadium would be used for Blue Ox baseball games and community events.</p>
<p>The minor league team now is based in Orion.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650))</p>
